00:24:21.193 --> 00:24:23.328
They've even added some more Storm Flakes

00:24:23.328 --> 00:24:26.498
to the base of the ice cream. So amazing.

00:24:27.933 --> 00:24:30.335
Mm, mm! Mm!

00:24:30.335 --> 00:24:33.505
Even though the M&amp;M's have melted,

00:24:34.906 --> 00:24:36.541
this is really yum.

00:24:36.541 --> 00:24:39.211
M&amp;M's always a good choice.
I like the M&amp;M's Storm.

00:24:39.211 --> 00:24:42.247
This is the date, the sticky date.

