It's living up to the
Australian name right now.

00:24:45.517 --> 00:24:48.553
It's really hot here. We're
just about to get into summer.

00:24:48.553 --> 00:24:52.958
And the sticky date did in fact
not make it from the journey

00:24:52.958 --> 00:24:56.161
