00:30:11.276 --> 00:30:12.710
and trying to jump on that whole

00:30:12.710 --> 00:30:14.813
boba sensation that's happening,

00:30:14.813 --> 00:30:18.750
but don't ruin a good thing.

00:30:18.750 --> 00:30:19.884
You've got a really good thing going.

00:30:19.884 --> 00:30:22.453
Your coffees are great.
Well, they're good.

00:30:24.656 --> 00:30:25.990
So, for those of you

00:30:25.990 --> 00:30:28.593
who haven't heard of Hungry Jack's before,

00:30:28.593 --> 00:30:33.331
it first opened up in
Perth, Australia, in 1971.

00:30:33.331 --> 00:30:35.700
You see, Burger King wanted to open

00:30:35.700 --> 00:30:37.202
restaurants in Australia,

00:30:37.202 --> 00:30:39.671
but the name Burger King
had already been trademarked

00:30:39.671 --> 00:30:41.706
by a local restaurant in Adelaide

00:30:41.706 --> 00:30:43.341
because Burger King actually

00:30:43.341 --> 00:30:45.944
had never trademarked it down under.

00:30:45.944 --> 00:30:48.813
A wealthy businessman, Jack Cowin,

00:30:48.813 --> 00:30:51.950
acquired the rights to the
Australian Burger King franchise

00:30:51.950 --> 00:30:55.053
and decided to name it Hungry Jack's.

00:30:55.053 --> 00:30:57.055
Hungry Jack's and Burger King

00:30:57.055 --> 00:30:59.657
actually went to court in 2001

00:30:59.657 --> 00:31:01.860
due to Burger King wrongfully trying

00:31:01.860 --> 00:31:04.762
to terminate an agreement in 1990,

00:31:04.762 --> 00:31:07.899
which allowed Hungry
Jack's to open and develop

00:31:07.899 --> 00:31:10.535
Burger King franchises in Australia.

00:31:10.535 --> 00:31:13.338
The development agreement,
as it was named,

00:31:13.338 --> 00:31:15.573
meant Hungry Jack's had to open

00:31:15.573 --> 00:31:18.643
a minimum of four restaurants per year

00:31:18.643 --> 00:31:20.511
in certain parts of Australia.

00:31:20.511 --> 00:31:22.647
Burger King began working with Shell

00:31:22.647 --> 00:31:25.650
to market its own restaurant
outlets in Australia,

00:31:25.650 --> 00:31:28.319
in a relationship that
excluded Hungry Jack's,

00:31:28.319 --> 00:31:31.155
which was not made aware
of this until a year later.

00:31:31.155 --> 00:31:33.658
That was in 1995.

00:31:33.658 --> 00:31:37.428
In 1995, Burger King withdrew the approval

00:31:37.428 --> 00:31:40.698
for third-party franchises to open,

00:31:40.698 --> 00:31:42.800
which meant that Hungry Jack's

00:31:42.800 --> 00:31:46.070
could not stick to the
development agreement.

00:31:46.070 --> 00:31:49.240
Eventually, Hungry Jack's
actually won the battle,

00:31:49.240 --> 00:31:51.309
and the judge ruled that Burger King

00:31:51.309 --> 00:31:53.745
had been breaching the contract.

00:31:53.745 --> 00:31:55.013
An agreement was made

00:31:55.013 --> 00:31:57.849
to rebrand the new Burger
King restaurants in Australia

00:31:57.849 --> 00:32:01.352
into Hungry Jack's as the
sole master franchise.

00:32:01.352 --> 00:32:04.856
Even though Australia is a huge country,

00:32:04.856 --> 00:32:07.792
it still doesn't have as many
Hungry Jack's restaurants

00:32:07.792 --> 00:32:10.628
compared to the number of Burger
King restaurants globally.

00:32:10.628 --> 00:32:13.865
There's only 452 Hungry Jack's,

00:32:13.865 --> 00:32:16.968
and that is as of September 2023.

00:32:16.968 --> 00:32:17.802
That's right.

00:32:17.802 --> 00:32:20.405
There's more than 18,700 Burger King

00:32:20.405 --> 00:32:22.106
restaurants around the world.

00:32:22.106 --> 00:32:24.709
That's 42 times more than Hungry Jack's.

00:32:24.709 --> 00:32:26.010
Texas is actually the state

00:32:26.010 --> 00:32:27.745
with the most Burger King restaurants,

00:32:27.745 --> 00:32:31.449
at 583 as of September 2023.

00:32:31.449 --> 00:32:32.517
This year, however,

00:32:32.517 --> 00:32:34.819
two of Burger King's largest franchises

00:32:34.819 --> 00:32:37.989
have filed for bankruptcy due
to low sales and high costs,

00:32:37.989 --> 00:32:39.891
and Burger King announced
that it will be closing

00:32:39.891 --> 00:32:42.560
a few hundred stores later this year.

00:32:42.560 --> 00:32:44.829
In August of this year,
Burger King was faced

00:32:44.829 --> 00:32:47.165
with a lawsuit over the
size of its Whoppers

00:32:47.165 --> 00:32:48.733
compared to what's on the menu.

00:32:48.733 --> 00:32:52.303
The lawsuit alleged that the
Whopper looked 35% larger

00:32:52.303 --> 00:32:54.706
with more than double the
meat in the advertisement

00:32:54.706 --> 00:32:57.175
compared to the Whopper
customers actually received.

00:32:57.175 --> 00:32:58.810
In response to the claim,

00:32:58.810 --> 00:33:01.346
a spokesperson for Burger King said that

00:33:01.346 --> 00:33:03.715
the patties featured in its ads

00:33:03.715 --> 00:33:06.284
are the same ones used in the Whoppers

00:33:06.284 --> 00:33:09.821
served all over this great nation.

00:33:09.821 --> 00:33:12.090
No way that's true, but moving on.

00:33:12.090 --> 00:33:13.825
I mean, the fact that Burger King sells

00:33:13.825 --> 00:33:16.461
2.1 billion Whoppers every year

00:33:16.461 --> 00:33:18.329
tells me the advertisement's working.

00:33:18.329 --> 00:33:20.331
So, all right, it's not the same size.

00:33:20.331 --> 00:33:22.734
Whatever, you ate it.
Get on with your life.

00:33:22.734 --> 00:33:27.171
Hungry Jack's also faced a lawsuit in 2020

00:33:27.171 --> 00:33:30.274
when McDonald's tried
to sue over its creation

00:33:30.274 --> 00:33:33.211
of the Big Jack, which McDonald's claimed

00:33:33.211 --> 00:33:35.747
was very similar to the Big Mac.

00:33:35.747 --> 00:33:38.583
I can understand the similarities there.

00:33:38.583 --> 00:33:42.120
Both parties were expected
to return to court

00:33:42.120 --> 00:33:45.890
at a later date, but the Big
Jack was dropped from the menu,

00:33:45.890 --> 00:33:48.493
so it seems the disagreement
may have been resolved.

00:33:48.493 --> 00:33:52.830
McDonald's is definitely Hungry
Jack's biggest competitor,

00:33:52.830 --> 00:33:54.999
with over 1,000 restaurants,

00:33:54.999 --> 00:33:56.634
but word on the street is

00:33:56.634 --> 00:33:59.537
Wendy's is going to expand in Australia,

00:33:59.537 --> 00:34:01.406
although there has been a mixed response

00:34:01.406 --> 00:34:03.041
about that entering here.

00:34:03.041 --> 00:34:05.510
McDonald's is the No. 1
competitor against Burger King,

00:34:05.510 --> 00:34:07.512
possibly because it has more locations,

00:34:07.512 --> 00:34:10.882
about 40,000 more as of 2022,

00:34:10.882 --> 00:34:12.984
which is over double the
amount of Burger Kings.

00:34:12.984 --> 00:34:14.152
McDonald's has always been larger,

00:34:14.152 --> 00:34:15.520
despite both chains starting

00:34:15.520 --> 00:34:17.722
around the same year in the 1950s.

00:34:17.722 --> 00:34:21.392
McDonald's is just optimized
for business domination.

00:34:21.392 --> 00:34:23.061
Burger King, I can't believe

00:34:23.061 --> 00:34:24.662
there's this many Burger
Kings, to be honest.

00:34:24.662 --> 00:34:26.831
McDonald's is the king.
They do everything right.

00:34:26.831 --> 00:34:28.733
They've always done everything right.

00:34:28.733 --> 00:34:31.302
Burger King has just been
looking at McDonald's

00:34:31.302 --> 00:34:32.970
and trying to copy what they do.

00:34:32.970 --> 00:34:36.074
I'm not a big Burger King
fan. I love McDonald's.

00:34:36.074 --> 00:34:39.010
McDonald's fries, way
better right out the gate.

00:34:39.010 --> 00:34:41.312
The burger selection at
McDonald's, way better.

00:34:41.312 --> 00:34:43.114
More convenient, better service.

00:34:43.114 --> 00:34:45.116
Yeah, I love Hungry Jack's.

00:34:45.116 --> 00:34:49.287
I recently have been
consuming more Hungry Jack's

00:34:49.287 --> 00:34:50.822
than any other fast food.

00:34:50.822 --> 00:34:52.523
I like Hungry Jack's. The
burgers are really good.

00:34:52.523 --> 00:34:54.192
I like the meat. I like the produce.

00:34:54.192 --> 00:34:56.461
The good thing about Hungry Jack's is

00:34:56.461 --> 00:34:59.530
you can taste the difference
in the quality of meat.

00:34:59.530 --> 00:35:02.700
It is definitely far more
superior in the make.

00:35:02.700 --> 00:35:05.303
It's a bit more of a step up

00:35:05.303 --> 00:35:08.206
from your average cheeseburgers.

00:35:08.206 --> 00:35:10.575
I think a lot of Aussies
perceive Hungry Jack's

00:35:10.575 --> 00:35:13.044
as something we grew up with.

00:35:13.044 --> 00:35:14.712
It definitely, even though

00:35:14.712 --> 00:35:17.582
it's the exact same thing as Burger King,

00:35:17.582 --> 00:35:21.152
Hungry Jack's for us resembles
something that's Australian

00:35:21.152 --> 00:35:24.522
or an Australian take on American burgers

00:35:24.522 --> 00:35:26.824
and American fast-food chains.

00:35:29.360 --> 00:35:30.695
Let's talk about price.

00:35:30.695 --> 00:35:34.799
In Australia, our Whopper
is 9.20 Australian dollars,

00:35:34.799 --> 00:35:38.236
which is 6.03 USD.

00:35:38.236 --> 00:35:41.305
Make it a meal with medium
fries and a medium Coke,

00:35:41.305 --> 00:35:43.975
it'd be 16.40 AUD,

00:35:43.975 --> 00:35:47.945
or 10.75 USD.

00:35:47.945 --> 00:35:51.649
In the US, a Whopper will cost you $6.89.

00:35:51.649 --> 00:35:54.352
That makes our Whopper 2% more expensive.

00:35:54.352 --> 00:35:55.520
If you want to make it a meal

00:35:55.520 --> 00:35:59.957
with a medium drink,
goozh, and a medium fry,

00:35:59.957 --> 00:36:02.493
this whole thing will cost you $12.18.

00:36:02.493 --> 00:36:05.229
That's an 18% increase in price.

00:36:05.229 --> 00:36:06.330
It looks like our menu

00:36:06.330 --> 00:36:09.200
might be a little bit cheaper than the US.

00:36:09.200 --> 00:36:11.969
I think the prices at Hungry
Jack's are quite reasonable.

00:36:11.969 --> 00:36:13.938
There are a lot of fast-food chains around

00:36:13.938 --> 00:36:16.174
that are quite expensive
for what you're getting,

00:36:16.174 --> 00:36:19.410
and I always think that
the price at Hungry Jack's

00:36:19.410 --> 00:36:20.878
is really quite competitive.

00:36:20.878 --> 00:36:22.980
Yeah, you know what?
12-something for this,

00:36:22.980 --> 00:36:25.149
that seems like a pretty good deal.

00:36:25.149 --> 00:36:27.251
I'm seeing all these news stories about,

00:36:27.251 --> 00:36:29.887
fast food is suddenly not cheap anymore.

00:36:29.887 --> 00:36:31.956
It used to be a lot less expensive,

00:36:31.956 --> 00:36:34.392
but I still think
12-something for all of this,

00:36:34.392 --> 00:36:35.760
I could definitely get full on all this.

00:36:35.760 --> 00:36:37.495
So, yeah, this is a pretty good deal.

00:36:40.164 --> 00:36:43.334
We took a look at the most calorific items

00:36:43.334 --> 00:36:45.203
on Hungry Jack's menu.

00:36:45.203 --> 00:36:49.540
In Australia, this is the Grill
Masters double cowboy Angus,

00:36:49.540 --> 00:36:54.111
coming in at 1,401 calories.

00:36:54.111 --> 00:36:56.480
However, if you got
the triple cheeseburger

00:36:56.480 --> 00:36:59.984
Super Stunner meal, which
comes with small fries,

00:36:59.984 --> 00:37:04.555
a small Coke, a mini Drumstick,
three chicken nuggets,

00:37:04.555 --> 00:37:09.527
that would come to 1,386 calories,

00:37:09.527 --> 00:37:12.263
which is still less than the burger,

00:37:12.263 --> 00:37:14.632
and with 15 calories remaining.

00:37:14.632 --> 00:37:16.701
For the US, it's the bacon king

00:37:16.701 --> 00:37:19.270
as the most calorific single menu item,

00:37:19.270 --> 00:37:22.473
coming in at 1,200 calories.

00:37:22.473 --> 00:37:24.475
Let's get the rest of the
stats on the screen there.

00:37:24.475 --> 00:37:26.744
If you were to get a cheeseburger meal

00:37:26.744 --> 00:37:29.380
with a small fry and a small drink, Coke,

00:37:29.380 --> 00:37:32.450
and a four-piece nugget
and a soft-serve cone,

00:37:32.450 --> 00:37:36.254
that's only 86 calories more
than just this bacon king.

00:37:38.990 --> 00:37:40.558
Unfortunately, US Burger King

00:37:40.558 --> 00:37:44.762
does not disclose its
ingredients, online or off.

00:37:44.762 --> 00:37:47.365
However, the Hungry Jack's website does

00:37:47.365 --> 00:37:49.834
have a full list of ingredients,

00:37:49.834 --> 00:37:52.503
and we found some pretty
interesting stuff.

00:37:52.503 --> 00:37:54.538
The cheese in the plant-based Whopper

00:37:54.538 --> 00:37:58.409
isn't actually fully vegetarian,

00:37:58.409 --> 00:38:01.746
as it contains products derived from cows!

00:38:01.746 --> 00:38:05.182
More specifically, it
contains calves' rennet,

00:38:05.182 --> 00:38:07.451
which is a type of lining of the stomach,

00:38:07.451 --> 00:38:08.919
and it's a type of enzyme

00:38:08.919 --> 00:38:10.688
commonly used in a lot of cheeses

00:38:10.688 --> 00:38:14.292
to help separate the curds and whey

00:38:14.292 --> 00:38:16.427
in the cheesemaking process.

00:38:16.427 --> 00:38:18.596
Liars! We trusted you!

00:38:18.596 --> 00:38:21.499
So if you actually want
to avoid animal products,

00:38:21.499 --> 00:38:25.002
be sure to specify "vegan"
Whopper when you order,

00:38:25.002 --> 00:38:26.804
not just a "plant-based" Whopper.

00:38:26.804 --> 00:38:30.508
A lot of ingredients like
to use big scientific names

00:38:30.508 --> 00:38:32.743
which sound a little scary,

00:38:32.743 --> 00:38:35.313
such as tocophorovello.

00:38:35.313 --> 00:38:38.916
I can't even say that.
Tocopherol. Tocophorol.

00:38:38.916 --> 00:38:42.486
But this is just another
word for vitamin E.

00:38:42.486 --> 00:38:44.522
Why not just say that?

00:38:44.522 --> 00:38:47.224
And it is found in foods
such as vegetable oils,

00:38:47.224 --> 00:38:49.660
nuts, and leafy greens.

00:38:49.660 --> 00:38:51.962
And we also found in barbecue sauce,

00:38:51.962 --> 00:38:53.898
there's Rochester sauce.

00:38:53.898 --> 00:38:56.534
I don't even know what
a Rochester sauce is.

00:38:56.534 --> 00:38:58.235
I know what a rottweiler is,

00:38:58.235 --> 00:38:59.670
and that's a dog.

00:38:59.670 --> 00:39:02.373
Rochester sauce, I'm not
too familiar with that.

00:39:02.373 --> 00:39:06.043
I am  ... what is that, Hungry Jack's?

00:39:06.043 --> 00:39:07.211
Still rolling.

00:39:09.480 --> 00:39:11.015
All right.

00:39:12.249 --> 00:39:15.386
[groans]

00:39:15.386 --> 00:39:17.421
Starting to lose it. It's that time.

00:39:17.421 --> 00:39:18.689
Uh-huh. All right!

